@ADShield.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5088

### Health
GET {{ADShield.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### AD connectivity + security-descriptor proof
### Fill with the same LDAP values as IdentitySphere App Registry.
POST {{ADShield.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ad/connectivity-test
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "connection": {
    "url": "ldap://dc.example.local:389",
    "bindDn": "DOMAIN\\svc_adshield",
    "bindPassword": "REPLACE_ME",
    "baseDn": "DC=example,DC=local",
    "timeoutMs": 30000,
    "tlsInsecure": false,
    "authType": "Basic"
  },
  "objectDn": "CN=Users,DC=example,DC=local",
  "readSecurityDescriptor": true
}
